      <description sparkle:format="markdown">## 更新内容

- 修复部分片源打开失败时被误判为播放结束的问题。现在会显示读取错误。
- 降低大型媒体库批量读取识别结果和影视资料时的内存占用。

需要 macOS 12.0 或更高版本。

## What’s New

- Fixed an issue where some sources that failed to open were treated as finished. EplayerX now reports a read error.
- Reduced memory use when loading recognition results and metadata for large media libraries.

Requires macOS 12.0 or later.
</description>
